  "hasDescription": [
    {
      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/f2476787-5401-319e-9eff-c43300ff9c8d",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Von 14 bis 20 Uhr: Treffpunkt im Jardin Partagé für einen musikalischen Nachmittag voller guter Energie!\n\nAuf dem Programm stehen:\n-\tCaravan Circus Band\n-\tBadaboom\n-\tDie Turbulettes\n-\tLampenschirm\n-\tTchiky Boom"
        ],
        "en": [
          "From 2pm to 8pm, join us at the Jardin Partagé for an afternoon of high-energy music!\n\nOn the program:\n-\tCaravan Circus Band\n-\tBadaboom\n-\tLes Turbulettes\n-\tLampshade\n-\tTchiky Boom"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Dalle 14.00 alle 20.00, recatevi al Jardin Partagé per un pomeriggio di musica ad alta energia!\n\nIn programma:\n-\tCaravan Circus Band\n-\tBadaboom\n-\tLes Turbulettes\n-\tParalume\n-\tTchiky Boom"
        ],
        "fr": [
          "De 14h à 20h, rendez-vous au Jardin Partagé pour une après-midi musicale pleine de bonne énergie !\n\nAu programme :\n-\tCaravan Circus Band\n-\tBadaboom\n-\tLes Turbulettes\n-\tAbat-jour\n-\tTchiky Boom"
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Ga van 14.00 tot 20.00 uur naar de Jardin Partagé voor een middag vol energieke muziek!\n\nOp het programma:\n-\tCaravan Circus Band\n-\tBadaboom\n-\tLes Turbulettes\n-\tLampenkap\n-\tBoom"
        ],
        "es": [
          "De 14:00 a 20:00, acuda al Jardin Partagé para disfrutar de una tarde de música enérgica\n\nEn el programa:\n-\tCaravan Circus Band\n-\tBadaboom\n-\tLes Turbulettes\n-\tPantalla\n-\tTchiky Boom"
        ]
      },
